      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "General proteolytic and antitryptic blood serum activity in acute emotionally-painful stress was investigated as well as that on the background of the before injected contrical. It was determined that in case of a stress there increases the general proteolytic activity of blood serum and at the same time antiproteolytic activity decreases. The coefficient of the relation of antiproteolytic activity to proteolytic activity of blood serum in case of a stress may become of 50% of the control. The introduction of inhibitor of proteinase contrical before the beginning of stressor influence promotes the decrease of general proteolytic activity to the level of the control indexes."},
